title: Little_Lona
---
<<start_counting>>

Jason: You wont find me this time, Lona!
Narrator: Little Lona stands beneath these ethereal trees, her eyes closed, her hands covering them for extra measure.
Little Lona: 10... 9... 8... 7... 6...
Narrator: She counts down the moments until she can open her eyes and win this game of hide and seek, as she always does.
Narrator: Her best friend Jason rushes off to hide.
Little Lona: 5... 4... 3... 2... 1! 
Little Lona: Ready or not, here I come!
Narrator: Little Lona opens her eyes and begins to search for Jason.

<<stop_counting>>
===
title: Baby_Birds
---
Little Lona: Is that a nest up there?
Little Lona: I wonder if any birds live there.
===
title: Egg_Click_1
---
Little Lona: Huh??? It moved!
===
title: Egg_Click_2
---
Little Lona: There hatching!
Little Lona: ...what the heck are those things?
===
title: Nest_Hatched
---
Little Lona: Okay... you guys are cute, strange little things.
Little Lona: Wow, and you're loud!
Little Lona: Heh...I make that noise when I'm hungry too.
Little Lona: I can't leave you like this. 
Little Lona: There's got to be some bugs nearby to feed you.
===
title: Hungry_Birds
---
Little Lona: Those freaks are still hungry...
Little Lona: I should find them a bug to eat.
===
title: Nest_Fed
---
Little Lona: There you go. All better, right?
Little Lona: Bye, little freaks.
===
title: Rock_Approach
---
Little Lona: They might like these bugs...
===

title: Rock_Approach_First
---
Little Lona: ...I wonder if those bugs are edible.
===

title: Rock_Push
---
Little Lona: NGHHH—come ON…
===
title: Rock_Eugh
---
Little Lona: Eugh.
===
title: Rock_Lunch
---
Little Lona: …Well, you're somebody's lunch.
===
title: Branch_Fallen
---
Little Lona: ...
Little Lona: Huh. That's convenient.
===
title: Branch_Pickup
---
Little Lona: This could come in handy.
Little Lona: Now to get Jason down from that tree.
===
title: Rock_Approach_Check
---
Little Lona: What a big bug.
Little Lona: I almost mistaked it for Jason.
<<if visited("Egg_Click_2")>>
    <<jump Rock_Approach>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Rock_Approach_First>>
